  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>Thank you to everyone who made a donation for my birthday last month. It means the world to me! I’m very appreciative and humbled.</p>\n<p>My new cookbook will be out on Dec 8, just under a month from now! You can <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">preorder your copy now</a> and get it as soon as it lands, and get a sneak peek of some recipes on our <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">Instagram</a>. </p>\n<p>Did you know my best-selling books <strong>How Not to Die</strong> and <strong>How Not to Diet</strong> are available in dozens of languages? For international ordering information, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/209667398-How-to-order-the-books-in-another-country\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/209667398-How-to-order-the-books-in-another-country\">go here</a>. </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">More on B12, Sorghum, and Plant-Based Meats in the New Volume </h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-66001 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"volume 52\" width=\"198\" height=\"198\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Vol-52-–-Download-Artwork.png 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 198px) 100vw, 198px\"/></a>My new volume, out today, is <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">available</a> as a streaming video so you can start watching the upcoming months of videos immediately. <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos/products/latest-in-clinical-nutrition-volume-52-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos/products/latest-in-clinical-nutrition-volume-52-digital\">See the full list of topics here</a>. All of these videos will eventually be available for free online on NutritionFacts.org, but they’re <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">available</a> now for those who don’t want to wait.</p>\n<div>And, remember, if you watch the videos on NutritionFacts.org or YouTube, you can access captions in several different languages. To find yours, click on the settings wheel on the lower-right corner of the video and then “Subtitles/CC.” </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>If you are a $25+ monthly supporter and opted in to our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/rewards/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">donor rewards</a>, you’d already be an expert on these new topics by now, having received an early, complimentary link to the new download. If you’d like to receive them before they’re available to the public, please consider becoming a monthly supporter.<p></p>\n<p>Sign up on the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid%3D1b9efb2a80%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584030563671000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoDoGzJPLB-mbmsd_JH22GbhQOrA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\">donation page</a> to become a $25+ monthly contributor and be given an opportunity to receive the newest downloads for free as long as your contributions are current.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Seeking Spanish Translation Volunteers  </h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-58779 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Spanish volunteers needed\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>We are looking for professional EN-ES translators to join our volunteer team to help translate our videos and blogs. For more information and to apply, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">go here</a>. </p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Doctor and Dietitian Q&amp;A</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-65997 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/2.jpg 1091w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Join me for another live Instagram Q&amp;A, this time with my good friend and distinguished colleague, <a href=\"https://nutrispeak.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutrispeak.ca/\">Vesanto Melina, MS, R.D</a>. </p>\n<p>Head over to the <a href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">NutritionFacts.org Instagram</a> page on <em><strong>November 25 at 8pm ET </strong></em>to get the answers to all of your health and nutrition questions.</p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">New Book from Brenda Davis!</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-65999 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Nourish book\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/Nourish-Instagram-post.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Rockstar dietitian Brenda Davis has a brand-new book out with pediatrician Reshma Shah. <a href=\"https://nourishthebook.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nourishthebook.com/\">NOURISH</a> is the nutrition guide parents have been waiting for. It is a reliable, evidence-based, and accessible resource for families who want to raise their children to be the healthiest they can be.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></a> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65204 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Symptoms of Vitamin B12 Deficiency\" width=\"301\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-16-The-Symptoms-of-Vitamin-B12-Deficiency.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 301px) 100vw, 301px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-symptoms-of-vitamin-b12-deficiency/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>The Symptoms of Vitamin B12 Deficiency</strong></a></p>\n<p>Vitamin B12 deficiency is known as “The Great Masquerader.” Take a look at the many facets of the symptoms.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65941 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-18-The-Healthiest-Food-Sources-of-Vitamin-B12-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 301px) 100vw, 301px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-healthiest-food-sources-of-vitamin-b12/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>The Healthiest Food Sources of Vitamin B12</strong></a></p>\n<p>What are the best Green-Light (whole food, plant-based) sources of vitamin B12 to meet the optimal dosage?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65112 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"What Is the Safest Metabolism Booster?\" width=\"301\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/51-13-What-Is-the-Safest-Metabolism-Booster.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 301px) 100vw, 301px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-is-the-safest-metabolism-booster/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>What Is the Safest Metabolism Booster?</strong></a></p>\n<p>To lose weight, drink water. Two cups of water can result in a surge of the adrenal hormone noradrenaline in your bloodstream, as if you had just smoked a few cigarettes or downed a few cups of coffee.</p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;A on Nov. 25</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month, I do a Q&amp;A live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>Nov. 25</strong></em> is the day this month.</p>\n<p>Join on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook</a> page or <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD\">YouTube</a> channel at 3pm ET. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</p>\n<p>You can find links to all of my past live Q&amp;As <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember I also have an <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">audio podcast</a> to keep you company.</p>"
